			<title>M.D.N.A. is Madonna new album title.</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/402-mdna-is-madonna-new-album-title.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/402-mdna-is-madonna-new-album-title.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>During the taping of her appearance on the Graham Norton show, this afternoon,  Madonna teased her fans by revealing the name of her upcoming CD. M D N A.To say the true she was nearly forced to reveal it because of the host asking her about new music and the new CD. Initially Madonna didn't want to talk about new music at all, but then she told the new album 's got a title that probably won't please everyone. The audience suggested about LUV, but Madonna answered with the 4 letter word MDNA. The news was later confirmed on Madonna's official facebook page.</p></div>]]></description>
